A/B: declare the second eMMC slot partition and rootdisk phandles (mt7987/R4-Lite).

Adds a `production_b` GPT partition node and /chosen rootdisk-emmc-a/-b phandles
(referencing emmc_rootfs, the label r4-lite-emmc.dtso gives block-partition-production)
so 315+z03 mtk_ft_system_setup can point /chosen/rootdisk at the active slot.
Keep the partition and /chosen additions in one hunk so they apply together.

--- a/target/linux/mediatek/dts/mt7987a-bananapi-bpi-r4-lite-emmc.dtso
+++ b/target/linux/mediatek/dts/mt7987a-bananapi-bpi-r4-lite-emmc.dtso
@@ -45,10 +45,15 @@
 			emmc_rootfs: block-partition-production {
 				partname = "production";
 			};
+			emmc_rootfs_b: block-partition-production_b {
+				partname = "production_b";
+			};
 		};
 	};
 };
 
 &{/chosen} {
 	rootdisk-emmc = <&emmc_rootfs>;
+	rootdisk-emmc-a = <&emmc_rootfs>;
+	rootdisk-emmc-b = <&emmc_rootfs_b>;
 };
